{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"clear-corridor","skinId":"paperbook","adapter":"legacy","sourceHashes":{"rules":"5dd24abfd9c6a43ca061cc2c3c98bbddabd322a29ea7a1d5ebc2fc7802188491","skin":"c8e62c3dd9206831403bcd6f0ec192d98353f26c4d48ddc07d39dd75554514d4"},"rules":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"clear-corridor","title":"畅通的生命通道","kind":"prevention","order":10,"location":"楼道 · 日常巡查","description":"选择自家轻便杂物和正确去处，收好后检查通道、出口前和消防设施前是否畅通。","safety":"仅在无火烟时整理自家轻便杂物。公共楼道不是储物空间；他人物品联系物主或物业，不擅自丢弃。不移动消防设施。火灾时不要因收拾物品耽误避险。人物试走只是演示，不是现实通道宽度验收。","briefing":"平日整理：先点物品，再选去处；也可以直接拖动。","objects":[{"id":"box","label":"纸箱","input":"drag","disabledWhen":["box-stored"]},{"id":"chair","label":"折叠椅","input":"drag","disabledWhen":["chair-stored"]},{"id":"case","label":"空行李箱","input":"drag","disabledWhen":["case-stored"]},{"id":"scooter","label":"玩具滑板车","input":"drag","disabledWhen":["scooter-stored"]},{"id":"inspector","label":"检查通道","input":"tap","hudAction":true,"requires":["box-stored","chair-stored","case-stored","scooter-stored"],"disabledWhen":["route-checked"]}],"goals":[{"id":"box-stored","label":"纸箱","object":"box"},{"id":"chair-stored","label":"折叠椅","object":"chair"},{"id":"case-stored","label":"空行李箱","object":"case"},{"id":"scooter-stored","label":"玩具滑板车","object":"scooter"},{"id":"route-checked","label":"检查通道","object":"inspector","showTarget":false}],"interactions":[{"id":"store-box","source":"box","mode":"drop","target":"storage","grants":["box-stored"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"store-box","feedback":"纸箱收进自家：公共楼道不是储物空间。"},{"id":"box-to-corner","source":"box","mode":"drop","target":"corner","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-box","feedback":"这里还是公共楼道，换个角落也不行。请收回自家。"},{"id":"box-to-fire-access","source":"box","mode":"drop","target":"fire-access","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-box","feedback":"这里要留给消防设施使用，不能把杂物挪到这里。"},{"id":"store-chair","source":"chair","mode":"drop","target":"storage","grants":["chair-stored"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"store-chair","feedback":"折叠椅收好：门前也不能堆物。"},{"id":"chair-to-corner","source":"chair","mode":"drop","target":"corner","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-chair","feedback":"这里还是公共楼道，换个角落也不行。请收回自家。"},{"id":"chair-to-fire-access","source":"chair","mode":"drop","target":"fire-access","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-chair","feedback":"这里要留给消防设施使用，不能把杂物挪到这里。"},{"id":"store-case","source":"case","mode":"drop","target":"storage","grants":["case-stored"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"store-case","feedback":"行李箱收好：靠墙摆整齐，也不等于可以占道。"},{"id":"case-to-corner","source":"case","mode":"drop","target":"corner","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-case","feedback":"这里还是公共楼道，换个角落也不行。请收回自家。"},{"id":"case-to-fire-access","source":"case","mode":"drop","target":"fire-access","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-case","feedback":"这里要留给消防设施使用，不能把杂物挪到这里。"},{"id":"store-scooter","source":"scooter","mode":"drop","target":"storage","grants":["scooter-stored"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"store-scooter","feedback":"滑板车收好：消防设施前要保持可接近。"},{"id":"scooter-to-corner","source":"scooter","mode":"drop","target":"corner","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-scooter","feedback":"这里还是公共楼道，换个角落也不行。请收回自家。"},{"id":"scooter-to-fire-access","source":"scooter","mode":"drop","target":"fire-access","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"return-scooter","feedback":"这里要留给消防设施使用，不能把杂物挪到这里。"},{"id":"check-route","source":"inspector","mode":"tap","requires":["box-stored","chair-stored","case-stored","scooter-stored"],"grants":["route-checked"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"check-route","feedback":"杂物收回自家，公共通道、出口前和消防设施前都要保持畅通。"}],"risk":{"mode":"elapsed","seconds":50,"initial":0,"warningAt":65,"peakFeedback":"训练时间到了，还没有完成收纳和检查。再试一次，不用着急。","timeout":"fail"},"completion":{"requires":["box-stored","chair-stored","case-stored","scooter-stored","route-checked"],"settleMs":1800,"title":"通道，畅通了","status":"完成","summary":"收回自家，不换角落；通道、出口和消防设施前都不堆